%I A401465 #8 Nov 02 2026 15:41:31
%S A401465 24,456,13384,477102,18876408
%N A401465 Number of fixed polyforms with n cells in the honeycomb of the 38-faced Voronoi cell of the point (427/6984, 761/6984, 1421/6984) under space group I4_132 (No. 214), one of Engel's 38-faced stereohedra.
%C A401465 The cell is the 38-faced space-filling polyhedron (3^12 4^11 5^6 6^5 8^1 16^1 20^1 28^1 faces, f-vector (70, 106, 38)) that is the Voronoi cell of the orbit of the general-position point (427/6984, 761/6984, 1421/6984) under space group I4_132 (No. 214), the representative point printed by Schmitt (2016) for the f-vector (70, 106, 38) in that group; its honeycomb has 24 cell types (translation classes), each cell with 38 face-neighbors. Polyforms are face-connected clusters of cells, counted up to lattice translation only.
%C A401465 Schmitt (2016) reports four combinatorial types of 38-faced Dirichlet stereohedra for I4_132, the types found by Engel (1981); no plesiohedron with more than 38 faces is known.
%C A401465 The honeycomb is chiral (all honeycomb symmetries are proper), so the one-sided and free counts coincide.
%C A401465 The symmetry group G of the tiling has order 24 modulo lattice translations (all 24 proper), and the counts satisfy the Burnside identity |G|*free(n) = Sum_g Fix_g(n).
%H A401465 Peter Engel, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1524/zkri.1981.154.3-4.199">Über Wirkungsbereichsteilungen von kubischer Symmetrie</a>, Z. Kristallogr. 154 (1981), 199-215.
%H A401465 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22502081">plesiohedron-census: certified space-filling polyhedra from a gated agentic search (code, certificates, catalog)</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%H A401465 Tyler Satchel Orden, <a href="/A401465/a401465.txt">Honeycomb adjacency and symmetry tables, with run instructions for the enumeration program of A398957</a>
%H A401465 Moritz W. Schmitt, <a href="https://doi.org/10.17169/refubium-14374">On Space Groups and Dirichlet-Voronoi Stereohedra</a>, Dissertation, Freie Universität Berlin, 2016 (table for No. 214, f-vector (70, 106, 38), generating point (427/6984, 761/6984, 1421/6984)).
%H A401465 Wikipedia, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_space_groups">List of space groups</a>.
